Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:59.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,《霍比特人》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾问我 是否把我所有的冒险经历都告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me once if I had told you everything there was to know about my adventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我告诉你我说的都是事实的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while I can honestly say I have told you the truth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有告诉你事实的全部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not have told you all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在老了 佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am old now Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是过去那个霍比特人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the same hobbit I once was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是到了把一切都告诉你的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is time for you to know what really happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It began long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一块离东方很远的土地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a land far away to the East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The like of which you will not find in the world today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.35,0:02:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一座城市叫做达尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was the city of Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的集市远近闻名 物美价廉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its market's known far and wide, full of the bounties of fine and vail, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,繁荣昌盛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}peaceful and prosperous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这座城市在中土之地最伟大的国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this city laid before the doors of the greatest kingdom in Middle-earth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊鲁柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是山下之王索尔的要塞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronghold of Thror, king under the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最强大的矮人之王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mightiest of the dwarf lords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔对自己的统治很有信心 从未担心过家族血脉会断绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thror ruled with utter surety, never doubting his house would endure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,王位传给他的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or his line lay secure in the lives of his son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:02:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子又传给孙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and grandson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 佛罗多 伊鲁柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Frodo. Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座建在大山深处的城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built deep within the mountain itself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的美无与伦比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beauty of this fortress city was a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的财富都深埋在地下 贮存了大量宝石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its wealth lay in the earth, in precious gems humed from rock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿石中金子多如泉涌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in great seams of gold running like rivers through stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人的工艺举世无双{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skill of the dwarves was unequaled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,精美绝伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fashioning object of great beauty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用钻石 祖母绿 红宝石和蓝宝石制作精美饰品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of diamond, emerald, ruby and sapphire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们继续向下采掘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever they delved deeper down into the dark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that is where they found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,山之心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart of the mountain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,家传宝钻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔赐它国王之宝的名号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thror named it the king's jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用它作为君权神授的象征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took it as a sign, a sign that his right to rule was divine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都必须向他致敬 包括精灵王瑟兰督伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All would pay homage to him. Even the great Elven king, Thranduil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但太平富足之年并未持久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the years of peace and plenty were not to last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子开始变坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly the days turned sour, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人警惕的夜幕降临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the watchful nights closed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔对黄金的爱变得狂热起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thror's love of gold had grown too fierce…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心开始变得病态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sickness had begun to grow within him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种精神上的病态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a sickness of the mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当这种病态壮大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where sickness thrives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄运开始降临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bad things will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始听到北方有飓风一样的声音传来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first they heard was a noise like a hurricane, coming down from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,山上的松树在热风中摇晃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pines on the mountain creaked and cracked in the hot dry wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴林 拉响警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balin, sound the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把守卫叫来 马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call out the guards, do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是条从北方飞来的恶龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a Firedrake from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,史矛革来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smaug… had come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天就是一场屠杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such wanton death was dealt that day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,山下之城的防御对史矛革来说形同虚设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for this city of men was nothing to Smaug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目光聚焦在别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eye was set on another price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对黄金有着黑暗而狂热的欲望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For dragons covet gold… with a dark and fierce desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊鲁柏…失守了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erebor… was lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙会守卫他的战利品直至死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a dragon will guard his plunder as long as he lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for your lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟兰督伊不愿拿他的部属冒险 来对抗恶龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrunduil would not risk the lives of his kin against the lawth of the dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天没有任何来自精灵的支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No help came from the Elves that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor any day since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,家园被夺 伊鲁柏的矮人们四处游荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robbed of their homeland, the dwarves of Erebor wandered the wilderness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经高高在上的人们也虎落平阳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The once mighty people brought low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的矮人王子在人类村落做工为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The young dwarf prince took work where he could find it, laboring in the villages of men. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.75,0:08:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有忘记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But always, he remembered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,月光下山上的浓烟 树木像火炬一样熊熊燃烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mountain smoke beneath the moon, the trees like torches blazing bright, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨龙在空中喷火 城市在火焰中化为灰烬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he had seen dragon fire in the sky, and a city turn to ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永不会原谅 永不会遗忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he never forgave…and he never forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的佛罗多 我就是这么出现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my dear Frodo, is where I come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分意外 因为一个巫师的意愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For quite by chance, and the will of a wizard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运选中我成为这段故事的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fate decided I would become part of this tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事的开头 就像你预料的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It began… well, it began as you might expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地底的洞穴里 居住着一个霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a hole in the ground, there lived a hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是一个又脏又湿 充满蠕虫和软泥味道的洞穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a nasty, dirty wet hole full of worms and oozy smells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个霍比特人的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a hobbit home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着这里有可口的食物 一个温暖的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means good food, a warm house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切在一个舒适的家里应有的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the comforts of home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你事 把你的脏爪子拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is private. Keep your sticky paws off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not ready yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么还没准备好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ready for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准备好给人看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对邀请函的答复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replies to the party invitations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够受欢迎的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是今天么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都说会来 除了萨克维尔·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all say they're coming, except for the Sackville-Bagginses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们希望你能亲自问他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who're demanding you ask them in person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的么？等我死了再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they, indeed. Over my dead body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能会觉得你说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd probably find that quite agreeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像觉得你有数不清的财宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem to think you have tunnels overflowing with gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一小箱子 离数不清差远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was one small chest, hardly overflowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有着巨魔的恶臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it still smells of troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,防患未然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking precautions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我抓到他们想偷走我的银饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I caught them making off with the silverware once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗贝拉·萨克维尔·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lobelia Sackville-Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的口袋里塞满了我的汤勺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had all my spoons stuffed in her pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreadful woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我…之后你要小心她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you keep an eye on her after I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm… when…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你什么…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're… what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing… nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人开始对你心存怀疑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, some people are beginning to wonder about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得你越来越古怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think you're becoming odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 古怪？ - 唔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- odd? - Hmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unsociable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合群？不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unsociable, me? Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行好帮我把这个放门口去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good lad and put that on the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:03.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（非生日宴宾客不得入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会来么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he will come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不会放过任何一个放他的魔法烟火的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he wouldn't miss a chance to let off his wiz poppers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会给我们带来一次精彩表演的 等着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll give us quite a show, you'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好 我走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then. I am off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off to where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,东郡森林 我要给他个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eastfarthing woods. I'm going to surprise him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 不会迟到哟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well go on then. You don't want to be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不喜欢迟到的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't approve being late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I ever was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些日子里 我一直都很准时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In those days, I was always on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多么可敬啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was entirely respectable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也从未有过什么意料之外的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing unexpected ever happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:55.18,Title,0,0,0,0,,《意外之旅》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:10.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（60年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.01,0:13:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是 祝我早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean to wish me a good morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说 不管我想不想 这个早晨都不错？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do you mean that it is a good morning whether I want it or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你只是想说 今天早上你感觉不错…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps you mean to say that you feel good on this particular morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你只是单纯地认为这会是个不错的早晨？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you simply stating that this is a morning to be good on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想可能是…上面的意思都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them at once, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮助你的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还有待观察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It remains to be seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找个人跟我一起去探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for someone to share in an adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,探险？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An adventure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想不到在布理西部…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't imagine anyone west of Bree…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会对探险有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who'd have much interest in adventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,又脏又让人不安 还不怎么舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty, disturbing… uncomfortable things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭都不能准点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make you late for dinner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为贝拉冬娜·图克的儿子一句早上好就能打发我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To think that I should have lived to be good-morninged by Belladonna Took's son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我是上门推销纽扣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if I was selling buttons at the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变了 而且并非都是朝好的方向变化 比尔博·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed, and not entirely for the better, Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我认识你么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你没见过我 你可能知道我的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you know my name, although you don't remember I belong to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gandalf…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫的意思就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Gandalf means…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫？那个放烟花的法师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Gandalf, the wandering wizard who made such excellent fireworks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,老图克仲夏夜请来的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Took used to have them on Midsummer's Eve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你还在做这生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea you were still in business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我应该做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where else should I be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 很高兴你还记得一些关于我的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm pleased to find you remember something about me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然仅仅是我的烟花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it's only my fireworks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么决定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你很有好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be very good for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我也很有趣 我会跟其他人说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and most amusing for me. I shall inform the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟谁… 不 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform the who-what-no, no. No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿不喜欢冒险 谢谢 今天不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not want any adventures here, thank you-not today, not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你去山那边问问 或者河那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you try over the hill or… across the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瓦林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwalin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo… Baggins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意为您效劳 不过我们认识么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at yours. But do we know each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,走哪边 小伙子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way, laddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从这边下去么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is- Is what? Down where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐 他说这里会有很多吃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supper. He said there'd be food. Lots of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说？谁说的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He- he said? Who said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道不错 还有么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good dish. Any more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？啊 有 有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Uh, oh, uh yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请自便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that, hum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会有人过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't expecting company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,门铃响了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴林…乐意为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balin… at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我觉得晚点儿可能会下雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I thing it might rain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟到了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late… for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By my beard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我上次见你的时候更心宽体胖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are shorter and wider than last we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖了 但是没宽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wider, not shorter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都够机灵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharp enough for both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉要打断你们一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Sorry. I hate to interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我觉得你们可能走错房间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but the thing is I'm not entirely sure you're in the right house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you eaten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非不欢迎有客人来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It- It's not that I don't like visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和隔壁的霍比特人一样好客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like visitors as much as the next hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望在他们来拜访之前 我就认识他们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do like to know them before they come… visiting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - I don't know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是奶酪呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought it a cheese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问题是 - 都变蓝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The thing is… - Gone blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是孔 但是它发霉了 - 现在的情况是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's riddled, but mold. - the thing is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么开口 一点儿也不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't-I don't know how to begin. Not in the slightest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.19,0:19:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 但我必须说 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be blunt, but I- but I had to speak my mind. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apology accepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 倒满 别吝啬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, fill it up brother, don't stint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could eat again, if you insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菲力 - 还有奇力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fili. - and Kili.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定就是巴金斯先生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You most be Mr. Boggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别进来 你们肯定走错屋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You can't come in, you've come to the wrong house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们…取消了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's you- Has it been canceled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人跟我们说啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没取消{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can- No, nothing's been canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a relief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点儿 我们刚磨好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful with these, we just had them sharpened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方真不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice, this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己建的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do it yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 这是祖传的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well no, it's been in the family for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我妈妈的嫁妆盒 你能不这样做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my mother's glory box, can you please not do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力 奇力 过来搭把手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fili, Kili come on, give us a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瓦林先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dwalin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挤挤 不然我们不可能都进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's shove this in the hole, or otherwise we'll never get everyone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone? How many more of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 家里没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. There's nobody home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 去烦别人吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away! And… bother somebody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家里已经有太多矮人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's far too many dwarves in my dining room as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是哪个猪头在跟我开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If- if this is some… blunt head's idea of a joke, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说 这真是无聊透顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only say, it is in very… poor taste!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,手拿开 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands off, you big lump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我的 抱歉 别碰我的酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my fr- Excuse me, not my wine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,果酱也不行 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the jam, please. Excuse me. Ex- Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:20:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了吧 你有切奶酪的刀子么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tad excessive, isn't it? Have you got a cheese knife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.97,0:21:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,切奶酪的刀子？他整个都吃掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cheese knife? He eats it by the block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 那是蒙戈爷爷的椅子 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, that's grandpa Mungo's chair, no-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 放回去 拜托 放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah, so is that. Take it back, please. Take it back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是古董 不是用来坐的 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is antique, not for sitting on. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是书 不是杯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a book, not a coaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那地图放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, put that map down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘道夫先生 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, Mr. Gandalf. - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,菊花茶要么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I tempt you with a cup of camomile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 朵力 我想我还是要点儿红酒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, no thank you Dori, a little red wine… for me I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力 奇力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Fili, Kili, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧音 格罗音 德瓦林 巴林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oin, Gloin… Dwalin, Balin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕佛 波佛 庞博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bifur, Bofur, Bombur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多利 诺力 - 不 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dori, Nori… - No, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的番茄 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not my dried tomatoes, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧力 - 不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ori! - No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 毕佛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you are quite right, Bifur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好像还少一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appear to be one dwarf short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is late, is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:22:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去北方参加我们的一个家族会议 他会来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He travel North to a meeting of our kin, he will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甘道夫先生 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Gandalf? - Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯红酒 有点儿果香{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little glass of red wine as requested, it's got a fruity bouquet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴林 - 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balin… - Catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要麦芽酒？给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants an ale? There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 数到三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, on the count of three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One! Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Com'on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这是桌布 不是洗碗布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex- Excuse me, that is a doily, not a dish cloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.41,0:23:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这上面都是洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's full of holes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它本来就是那样的 那是针织的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to look like that, it's crochet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有个球的话 会很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and a wonderful game it is too, if you got the balls for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些惹祸的烦人的矮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bebother and confusticate these dwarves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.82,0:23:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的比尔博 到底怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Bilbo, what on earth is the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.08,0:23:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.55,0:23:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我周围都是矮人 他们来这儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am surrounded by dwarves. What they're doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你习惯了他们 这会是个快乐的聚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're quite a merry gathering… once you get used to 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to get used to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的厨房 地毯上都是泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the state of my kitchen! There's mud trodding the carpet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.79,0:23:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的储藏室像被洗劫了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they- they've pillaged the pantry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没跟你说他们在浴室里做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even gonna tell you what they've done in the bathroom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把水管搞得一塌糊涂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've all but destroyed the plumbing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们在我屋里做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what they're doing in my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打断你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I'm sorry to interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该把盘子放哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what sha'd do with my plate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 欧力 给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, Ori, give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我妈妈的藏品 已经有一百多年历史了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my mother's Westfarthing pottery, it's over a hundred years old!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能不能别这样？你们会把它们弄钝的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And- and ca- can you not do that, you'll blunt them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, d'you hear that, lads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.73,0:24:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们会把刀子弄钝的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says we'll blunt the knives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.30,0:24:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 刀子弄钝 叉子弄弯 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Blunt the knives, bend the forks ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 瓶子弄碎 木头烧完 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Smash the bottles and burn the corks ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.29,0:24:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 瓶子打破 盘子打烂 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Chip the glasses and crack the plates ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这些事情让比尔博·巴金斯生厌 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's what Bilbo Baggins hates ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 剪破衣服 踩烂黄油 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Cut the cloth and tread on the fat ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.55,0:24:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 剩下骨头留在卧室 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Leave the bones on the bedroom-mat ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.47,0:24:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 牛奶倒进储物室 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Pour the milk on the pantry-floor ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 红酒洒上每扇门 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Splash the wine on every door ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 瓦罐倒进沸腾的碗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dump the crocks in a boiling bowl ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再用大棒把它打烂 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Pound them up with a thumping pole ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当你结束还有完卵 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When you've finished, if any are whole ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大厅一扔保准完蛋 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Send them down the hall to roll! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.03,0:24:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这些事情让比尔博·巴金斯生厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's what Bilbo Baggins hates! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.04,0:25:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.22,0:25:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说这地方很好找么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said this place would be easy to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都迷路两次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my way, twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.13,0:25:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是门上有记号 我根本找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have found it at all, had it not been for that mark on the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.28,0:25:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,记号？门上没记号 一周前才粉刷过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark? There's no mark on that door, it was painted a week ago!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 这是我亲手做的手脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a mark, I have put it there myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯 请允许我向你介绍我们的领头人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo Baggins, allow me to introduce the leader of our company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是那个霍比特人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.43,0:25:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说 巴金斯先生 你打过架么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me Mr. Baggins, have you done much fighting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.63,0:25:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斧头还是剑？你一般用什么武器？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axe or sword, what's your weapon of choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.79,0:25:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果非要说的话 我板栗游戏玩得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do have some skill at conkers, if you must know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不觉得这有什么用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I fail to see… why that's relevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.31,0:25:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought as much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么看都像个杂货商 而不是飞贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks more like a grocer than a burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊瑞德隆会议有什么消息？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news from the meeting in Ered Luin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.05,0:26:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都来么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they all come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.05,0:26:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个国家的使者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}envoys from all seven kingdoms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁丘陵矮人怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did the dwarvesof the Iron Hill say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.98,0:26:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,达因会一起来么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Dain with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.29,0:26:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.30,0:26:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说这只是我们的探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say this quest is ours, and ours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要探险？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing a quest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博 把灯调亮点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo, my dear fellow, let us have a little more light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.41,0:26:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路向东{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far to the East, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,越过山岭和河流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over ranges and rivers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.90,0:26:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸过森林和荒地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond woodlands and wastelands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.21,0:26:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一座孤独的山峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lies a single solitary peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.18,0:27:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lonely Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 欧音已经看过预言 预言说：是时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, Oin has read the portents, and the portents say: it is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.71,0:27:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到乌鸦像预言中说的那样飞回山里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravens have been seen flying back to the mountain as it was foretold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.56,0:27:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当前朝的鸟飞回伊鲁柏时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the birds of the old return to Erebor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.72,0:27:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽的统治就到头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reign of the beast will end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.84,0:27:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么野兽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.91,0:27:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能是指可怕的史矛革{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that would be a reference to Smaug the terrible, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那个时代最大的灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}chiefest and greatest calamity of our age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.86,0:27:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷火的鼻息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airborne fire breather…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剃刀一样的牙齿 肉钩一样的爪子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}teeth like razors, claws like meat hooks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度热爱黄金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}extremely fond of precious metals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道龙是什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know what a dragon is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.81,0:27:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕 我等着它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid, I'm up for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.78,0:27:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他的屁股尝尝矮人兵器的味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give him a taste of the dwarfish iron right up his jacksy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.48,0:27:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,左下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.56,0:27:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是有一支军队 这个探险也很难完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The task would be difficult enough with an army behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况我们只有十三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we number just thirteen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是最好最聪明的十三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not thirteen of the best nor brightest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.03,0:27:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谁蠢呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Who you're calling dimp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.15,0:28:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们虽然人数少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be few in number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都是战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're fighters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是 战斗到最后一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us! To the last one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们忘了我们还有一个巫师同行么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you forget we have a wizard in our company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.31,0:28:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫他一生中已经杀了数百头龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf, who have killed hundreds of dragons in his time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我没那么说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well no, uh, I- I wouldn't say-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.31,0:28:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.23,0:28:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了多少头龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how many dragons have you killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 把数字告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, give us a number!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.55,0:28:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Give me- Please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.23,0:28:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们能看到这些征兆 难道别人就看不到么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have read these signs, do you not think others will have read them too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经谣言四起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumors have begun to spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.60,0:28:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨龙史矛革已经六十年未现身了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragon Smaug has not been seen for 60 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.06,0:28:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多目光望着东方 估摸… 思索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes look East to the mountain, assessing… wondering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,权衡风险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}weighing the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们的巨大财富现在正无人看守 我们要坐等…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the vast wealth of our people now lies unprotected. Do we sit back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.04,0:28:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人占有我们的财富么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while others claim what is rightfully ours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.85,0:29:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我们要把握机会夺回伊鲁柏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do we seize this chance to take back Erebor?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了前门被封死了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget the front gate is sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.56,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有进山的路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way into the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的巴林 那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my dear Balin, is not totally true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How came you by this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.11,0:29:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你父亲索恩托我保管的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was given to me by your father… by Thrain… for safekeeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是你的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is yours now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.49,0:29:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是把钥匙的话…那肯定有一扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is a key… there must be a door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.31,0:29:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面说有一条秘道通向底层大厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These runes speak of a hidden passage to the lower halls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有别的路进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another way in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们能找到它 但是矮人的大门在锁着时都是隐形的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we can find it, but dwarf doors are invisible when closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.32,0:29:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在这张地图上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer lies hidden somewhere in this map, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.44,0:30:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法找到 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I do not have the skill to find it, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.81,0:30:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土之地有人能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are others in Middle-earth who can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.75,0:30:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里的计划需要很多的秘密行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The task I have in mind will require a great deal of stealth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.33,0:30:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能缺乏勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no small amount of courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.42,0:30:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们够谨慎又够聪明 我相信我们就能成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we're careful and clever, I believe that it can be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.38,0:30:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们为什么需要一个飞贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we need a burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 需要一个好手 一个专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. And a good one too. An expert, I would imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.87,0:30:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.24,0:30:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他是个专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he's an expert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.67,0:30:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？不不不 我不是飞贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No. No no no no. I- I'm not a burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子都没偷过东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never stolen anything in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我不得不同意巴金斯先生说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid I have to agree with Mr. Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不是飞贼的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hardly burglar material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 荒野可不是无法照顾自己的人能生活的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, the wild is no place for gentle folk who can neither fight nor fend for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.00,0:31:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我说巴金斯是一个飞贼 他就是一个飞贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! If I say Bilbo Baggins is a burglar, then a burglar he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.45,0:31:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍比特人脚步灵敏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits are remarkably light on their feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.15,0:31:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 他们可以通过任何地方而不被发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, they can pass unseen by most if they choose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.66,0:31:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且巨龙已经习惯了矮人的味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and while the dragon is accustomed to the smell of a dwarf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他对霍比特人一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the scent of a hobbit is all about unknown to him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.45,0:31:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们来说是个优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives us a distinct advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.70,0:31:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我找团队中的第十四个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to find the 14th member of this company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.84,0:31:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选中了巴金斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have chosen Mr. Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.83,0:31:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是深藏不露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more into him than his appearances suggest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能贡献的比你们想象中的要多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's got a great deal more to offer than any of you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至他自己都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}including himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点你们必须相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must trust me on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.80,0:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.52,0:31:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.67,0:31:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.40,0:31:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把契约给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him your contract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.19,0:31:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们加入 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're in. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.16,0:31:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是最普通的契约 关于费用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the usual: summary about the pocket expenses…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.13,0:31:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所需时间 酬劳和葬礼安排等事项的说明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}time required, remuneration, funeral arrangements, so forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.71,0:32:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬礼安排？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funeral arrangements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.84,0:32:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能保证他的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot guarantee his safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.22,0:32:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.00,0:32:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会对他的命运负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not be responsible for his fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.21,0:32:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.71,0:32:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「全部现金付款 金额最高不超过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…total's cash on delivery up to but not exceeding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有获益的十四分之一「 看起来挺公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one fourteenth of total profit if any". Seems fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.78,0:32:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现有的团队不会对由持续伤害造成的伤残负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The present company shall not be liable for injuries inflicted by or sustained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.65,0:32:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括但不限于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a consequence thereof, including, but not limited to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.43,0:32:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,撕裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lacerations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.31,0:32:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖脏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}evisceration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.53,0:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incineration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.94,0:32:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他一眨眼就会把你的血肉熔化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, aye, he'll melt the flesh off your bones in the blink of an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.01,0:32:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好么 小伙子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright, laddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.19,0:32:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Yeah, I fe-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.60,0:32:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿头晕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel a bit faint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.35,0:32:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它想象成会飞的火炉就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think furnace, with wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点空气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I-I-I need air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.98,0:33:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,火光闪过 烧灼的疼痛过后 嘭一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash of light, searing pain, and puf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.81,0:33:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就变成一撮灰烬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing more than a pile of ash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.63,0:33:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.85,0:33:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会安慰人 毕佛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very helpful, Bifur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事儿 就让我安静坐会儿就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be alright. Just… let me… sit quietly for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经坐了够久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been sitting quietly for far too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.11,0:33:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.33,0:33:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did doilies…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.13,0:33:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些小饰物和你妈妈的盘子对你来说这么重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your mother's dishes become so important to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.77,0:33:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得那个在树林四处找寻精灵的小霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember a young hobbit who was always running off in search of Elves, in woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.79,0:33:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在外面待到很晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would stay out late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.25,0:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑后 带着泥巴 树枝和萤火虫回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home, after dark, trailing mud and twigs and fireflies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.83,0:33:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个喜欢探索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young hobbit who would've liked nothing better than to find out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.62,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏尔之外的世界的小霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was beyond the borders of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.39,0:33:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界并不存在于你的书和地图上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is not in your books and maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.81,0:33:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这么跑出去探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just go running off into the blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:34:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是巴金斯家的乡巴佬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Baggins… of Bagg End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.76,0:34:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是一个图克家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are also a Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.81,0:34:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的曾曾曾曾祖叔吼牛·图克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that your great great great great uncle, Bullroarer Took, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.28,0:34:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体型巨大 可以骑一匹真正的马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was so large, he could ride a real horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well he could!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.52,0:34:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在绿野战役 他加入讨伐哥布林的大军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the battle of Greenfields, he charged the Goblin ranks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,挥舞着大棒 抡飞了哥布林国王的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he swung his club so hard, it knocked the Goblin king's head clean off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.80,0:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那头颅飞起几百码 最后滚到兔子洞里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sailed a hundred yards through the air, and went down a rabbit hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.20,0:34:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战役就此取得了胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thus the battle as won…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.38,0:34:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此还发明了高尔夫球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the game of golf invented at the same times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.83,0:34:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是你瞎编的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe you made that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.24,0:34:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的好故事都需要这样的修饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all good stories deserve embellishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来以后 也会有一两个自己的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have a tale or two to tell of your own when you come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.11,0:34:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能保证我能回来么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you promise that I will come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.99,0:34:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你能回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:34:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会变得很不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll not be the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.66,0:35:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.58,0:35:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不能签这合同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Gandalf, I can't sign this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.24,0:35:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the wrong hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.95,0:35:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎失去了我们的飞贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears we have lost our burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.51,0:35:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是最好的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.78,0:35:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气总是不站在我们这一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds were always against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.33,0:35:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们都是些什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, what are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.87,0:35:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,商人 矿工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merchants, minors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.24,0:35:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,锅炉匠 玩具工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tinkers, toy makers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.59,0:35:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是成为传奇的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly the stuff of legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.02,0:35:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅有的几个战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a few warriors amongst us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.53,0:35:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是老战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.68,0:35:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带着这里的每一个矮人统率铁丘陵军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take each and every one of these dwarves over an army from the Iron Hills…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为每当我召唤他们 他们就会响应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for when I called upon them, they answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.06,0:35:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.68,0:35:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.20,0:35:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,热忱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A willing heart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此以外 我别无所求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can ask no more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.89,0:36:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要做这些的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.41,0:36:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.14,0:36:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经让我们感到自豪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done honorably by our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.01,0:36:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在蓝山为我们开创了新生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have bulit a new life for us in the Blue Mountains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.01,0:36:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太平富裕的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a life of peace and plenty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.83,0:36:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,比伊鲁柏所有的黄金更珍贵的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life that is worth more than all the gold in Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.41,0:36:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个责任从爷爷传给了我父亲 现在又落到了我手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my grandfather to my father, this has come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.93,0:36:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做梦都想伊鲁柏的矮人们能够夺回故土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They dreamt of the day when the dwarves of Erebor would reclaim their homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.61,0:36:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没有选择 巴林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no choice, Balin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.55,0:36:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.56,0:36:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就和你一起战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are with you, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个梦想会实现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.70,0:37:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从远方寒冷的高山 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Far over the misty mountains cold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.34,0:37:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来到幽深古老的窑洞 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To dungeons deep and caverns old ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.67,0:37:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们必须在破晓之前出发 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We must away ere break of day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.52,0:37:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去寻找久已遗忘的财富 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To find our long forgotten gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 松树在高山上摇摆 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The pines were roaring on the height ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.84,0:38:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 高风在夜空中呜咽 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The winds were moaning in the night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.97,0:38:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 熊熊烈火 火焰蔓延 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The fire was red, it flaming spread ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.49,0:38:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 树木如炬 熠熠闪光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The trees like torches blazed with light ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.83,0:40:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博 有什么追你么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Mr. Bilbo. Where're you after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.25,0:40:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能停 我已经迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop, I'm already late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.27,0:40:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.57,0:40:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going on an adventure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.10,0:40:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.02,0:41:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.14,0:41:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经签了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I signed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.04,0:41:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything appears to be in order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.75,0:41:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯大人 欢迎你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, master Baggins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.64,0:41:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入索林·橡木盾的队伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the company of Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.79,0:41:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一匹马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a pony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.39,0:41:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 没那必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no no no. That- that won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.27,0:41:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定我走着能跟得上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can- I am sure I can keep up on foot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.40,0:41:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常步行散步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I- I've done my fair share of… walking holidays, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.14,0:41:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最远还去过蛙山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even got as far as the Frog Mountain once-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.34,0:42:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点诺力 付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Nori. pay up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.96,0:42:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.35,0:42:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.30,0:42:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打赌 赌你会不会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh they took wagers…on whether or not you would turn up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人赌你不会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them bet that you wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.02,0:42:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.47,0:42:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的朋友 我从没怀疑过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear fellow…I never doubted of you for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.91,0:42:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是马毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh it's horsehair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.04,0:42:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,过敏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.33,0:42:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.63,0:42:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来 我们得掉头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! We have to turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.35,0:42:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in earth is the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.24,0:42:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记带手帕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot my handkerchief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.74,0:42:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.10,0:42:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.44,0:42:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.10,0:43:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须习惯没有手帕的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to manage without pocket handkerchiefs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.12,0:43:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多其他事情 比尔博·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a good many other things, Bilbo Baggins, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.02,0:43:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们旅程结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we reach our journey's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.52,0:43:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生于夏尔的延绵山岭和小河旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born to the rolling hills and little rivers of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.21,0:43:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在家已在身后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But home is now behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.18,0:43:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而世界在前方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.00,0:44:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙 真是个好家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl! Here's a good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.69,0:44:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们俩的小秘密 香桃儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our little secret, Myrtle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.21,0:44:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也别告诉 嘘 嘘…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell no one, shh shh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.02,0:44:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.18,0:44:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.17,0:44:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.76,0:44:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throat cutters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.13,0:44:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有几十个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'd be dozens of them out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.12,0:44:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的低洼地里都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The low lands are crawling with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.72,0:44:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌晨大家都熟睡的时候 他们就发动袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They strike, in the wee small hours, when everyone's asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.01,0:44:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,又快又静 没有尖叫声 只有血流遍地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick and quiet, no screams. Just lots of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.61,0:44:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得很有趣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.47,0:44:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得被半兽人夜袭是有趣的事情？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think a night raid by orcs is a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.64,0:44:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't mean anything by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.98,0:44:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.13,0:45:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对这个世界根本一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.09,0:45:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意 小伙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind him, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.64,0:45:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林比大多数人更加仇恨半兽人是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin has more cause than most to hate orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.82,0:45:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶龙占领了孤寂山后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the dragon took the Lonely Mountain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.25,0:45:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔国王设法收回古矮人族的摩瑞亚王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Thror tried to reclaim the ancient dwarf kingdom of Moria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.03,0:45:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的敌人已经先到一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our enemy had got' there first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.83,0:45:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩瑞亚已经被半兽人大军占领{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moria had been taken by legions of orcs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.75,0:45:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,首领则是他们种族里最卑鄙的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}led by the most vile of all their race…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.96,0:45:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿索格… 毁灭者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azog… the Defiler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.55,0:46:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚达巴山的半兽人已经宣誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The giant Gundabad orc had sworn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要彻底摧毁杜林的防线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wipe out the line of Durin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.63,0:46:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从把国王斩首开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He began by beheading the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.01,0:46:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.08,0:46:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,索恩 就是索林的父亲 因悲痛过度而疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrain, Thorin's father, was driven mad by grief, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.99,0:46:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是失踪了 被俘虏 还是被杀 我们不得而知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went missing, taken prisoner or killed, we did not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.20,0:46:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们群龙无首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were leaderless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.50,0:46:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,溃败和死亡笼罩着我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeat and death were upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.99,0:46:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而就在那时…我看到了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is when… I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.98,0:47:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位年轻的矮人国王子降伏了这个白半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young dwarf prince facing down the Pale Orc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.50,0:47:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他独自抗击这个可怕的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stood alone against this terrible foe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.69,0:47:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的盔甲破了 没有武器 只有一根橡木枝做的盾牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His armor rent, wielding nothing but an oaken branch as a shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.40,0:47:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭者阿索格那天意识到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azog the Defiler learned that day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.38,0:47:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜林的防线没有那么容易被击破{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the line of Durin would not be so easily broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.89,0:48:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重整队伍 把半兽人击退回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our forces rallied, and drove the orcs back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.05,0:48:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人被我们打败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemy had been defeated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.42,0:48:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那天晚上没有庆功宴 也没有胜利的歌声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was no feast, nor song that night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.35,0:48:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们伤亡惨重 我们极度悲痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our dead were beyond the count of grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.46,0:48:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有很少人幸存了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We few, had survived…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.08,0:48:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我就在想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought to myself then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:49:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人…我可以追随{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is one… who I could follow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.03,0:49:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这样一个人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.05,0:49:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以称他为王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could call king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个白半兽人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Pale Orc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.62,0:49:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后来怎样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.24,0:49:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他溜回了他的城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slunk back into the hall whence he came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个肮脏的家伙很久之前就因伤而亡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That filth died of his wounds long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.22,0:50:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉主人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.65,0:50:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现矮人了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.80,0:50:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 甘道夫先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Mr. Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.42,0:50:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能对这大雨施点魔法吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you do something about this deluge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.07,0:50:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在下雨 矮人大人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is raining, master dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.66,0:50:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束一场雨最好的办法 就是让雨下完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will continue to rain until the rain is done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.19,0:50:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想改变这个世界的天气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to change the weather of the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.27,0:50:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该找别的巫师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should find yourself another wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.83,0:50:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.69,0:50:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.32,0:50:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的巫师？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other wizards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.45,0:50:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师一共有五个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are five of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.03,0:50:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最厉害的是白袍巫师萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest of our order is Saruman. The White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.59,0:50:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有两个蓝袍巫师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there are the two blue wizards…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.48,0:51:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎忘记他们的名字了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}D'you know, I have quite forgotten their names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.01,0:51:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第五个是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is the fifth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.57,0:51:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是褐袍巫师瑞达加斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would be Radagast. The Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.69,0:51:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是很厉害的巫师还是跟你一样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he a great wizard or is he more like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.48,0:51:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他是个非常厉害的巫师 就他的领域而言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's a very great wizard… in his own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.63,0:51:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他性格温和 喜欢和动物待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a gentle soul who prefers the company of animals to others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.16,0:51:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他密切关注着东方的广阔林地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He keeps a watchful eye over the vast forestlands to the East, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.42,0:51:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是件好事 因为邪恶总是在这个世界上寻找立足之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a good thing too, for always evil will look to find a foothold in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.67,0:51:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.38,0:51:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.72,0:52:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.59,0:52:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.03,0:52:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 让他好好呼吸 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back, give him some air, for goodness sake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.17,0:52:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么不起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand why it's not working, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.92,0:52:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不像是巫术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not as if it's witchcraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.38,0:53:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witchcraft…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.78,0:53:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.64,0:53:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巫术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.79,0:53:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗而强大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dark and powerful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.90,0:53:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.00,0:54:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些邪恶的东西到底从哪儿来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where on this good earth do those foul creatures come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,古堡那儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old fortress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.41,0:54:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.00,0:55:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们在这里扎营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We camp here for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.32,0:55:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力 奇力 看好马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fili, Kili, look after the ponies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.67,0:55:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保它们跟你们待在一块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you stay with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.02,0:55:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个农民和他家人曾住在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A farmer and his family used to live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.26,0:55:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧音 葛罗音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oin, Gloin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.19,0:55:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.26,0:55:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,生起火来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fire going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.10,0:55:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得继续前进更加明智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be wiser to move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.89,0:55:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能赶到藏身谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make for the hidden valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.10,0:55:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've told you already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.38,0:55:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会靠近那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not go near that place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.25,0:55:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.49,0:56:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵族可以帮我们 我们可以获得食物 休息和建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Elves could help us, we could get food, rest, advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要他们的建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need their advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.04,0:56:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有张看不懂的地图 爱隆国王可以帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a map that we cannot read. Lord Elrond could help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.72,0:56:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶龙袭击伊鲁柏时 精灵族的帮助在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dragon attacks Erebor. What help came from the Elves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.44,0:56:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人侵略摩瑞亚 玷污我们的圣堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs plunder Moria, desecrate our sacred halls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.02,0:56:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵族在那里袖手旁观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Elves looked on and did nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.75,0:56:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然让我去找那群背叛我祖父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask me to seek out the very people who betrayed my grandfather…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.22,0:56:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,背叛我父亲的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who betrayed my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.66,0:56:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是你的祖辈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are neither of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.45,0:56:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你地图和钥匙可不是为了让你纠结于过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not give you that map and key for you to hold on to the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.58,0:56:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为那些该由你保管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know they were yours to keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.33,0:56:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.82,0:56:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫 你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找这里唯一还有理智的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seek the company of the only one around here who's got any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.69,0:56:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.61,0:56:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己 巴金斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myself, mister Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够矮人的气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough of dwarves for one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.22,0:57:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧 庞博 都饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Bumbur, we're hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.87,0:57:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还会回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.52,0:57:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这么久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.88,0:57:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.59,0:57:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.37,0:57:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是个巫师 他想怎样就怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a wizard! He does as he chooses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.63,0:57:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 搭把手 给端过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Do us a favor, take this to the lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.39,0:57:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吃了 你已经吃得够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, you've had plenty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该看守马儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be looking after the ponies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.83,0:57:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们遇到了一个小问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only we've encountered a…slight problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.18,0:57:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有16匹马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had sixteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.13,0:57:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有14匹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's… fourteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛茜和邦戈不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daisy and Bungle are missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.86,0:57:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.61,0:57:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是好事 真的不是好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's… not good, and that is not good at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.64,0:57:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是该告诉索林？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we tell Thorin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 还是不要打扰他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, no. Let's not worry him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我们当中的职业大盗 我们觉得你应该想追查到底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As our official burglar, we thought you might like to look into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.09,0:58:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, eh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.80,0:58:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好像有大家伙把这些树连根拔起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it looks as if something big uprooted these trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.42,0:58:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was our thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.37,0:58:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个很大的家伙 而且也许很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something very big, and possibly quite dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.77,0:58:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! There's a light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.50,0:58:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.26,0:58:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.73,0:58:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.59,0:58:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,山怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.27,0:59:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓了小香桃和小薄荷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Myrtle and Minty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.84,0:59:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们要抓去吃了 我们应该做点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're gonna eat them, we have to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.84,0:59:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你应该做点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.04,0:59:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,山怪们又慢又笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mountain trolls are slow and stupid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.85,0:59:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你身材苗条 - 我？不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and you're so small, - Me? Me, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.91,0:59:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看不到你 绝对安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll never see you. It's perfectly safe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.98,0:59:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就跟你后边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.06,0:59:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遇到麻烦 就学谷仓猫头鹰叫两声 棕色猫头鹰叫一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you run into trouble hoot twice like a barn owl, once like a brown owl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.74,0:59:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,学谷仓猫头鹰叫两声 学棕色…叫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice like a barn owl, hoot twice like a… brown, hoots like a-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.33,0:59:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这是个好主意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a- ah, are you sure this is a good idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.28,0:59:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天吃羊肉 今天吃羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutton yesterday, mutton today, and blimey, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.77,0:59:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会明天还吃羊吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it don't look like mutton again tomorrer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.20,0:59:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛看哪里了？这不是羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What yer would be? These ain't sheep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.04,0:59:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是野马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These is waste nags!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.02,0:59:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦不 马？ - 我不喜欢马肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh no, horse? - I don't like horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.42,0:59:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不喜欢 一点肥肉都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never have. Not enough fat on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.41,0:59:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也比那个难嚼的老农好 他只有皮和骨头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's bett'r of a leathery ol' farmer. Only skin and bone he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.74,0:59:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在还要让我剔牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still pickin' bits of him out o' me teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.55,0:59:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱 鼻涕变油花儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's lovely, that is. A floater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.42,0:59:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能调调味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Might improve the flavor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.90,1:00:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我多弄点儿出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Heve more where that came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.77,1:00:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no yer don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.99,1:00:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.94,1:00:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能把鼻涕捞出来啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I hope yer gonna gut these nags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.71,1:00:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢那块臭不拉叽的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the stinky parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.21,1:00:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.56,1:00:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿死了 今晚我们吃马肉还是怎么着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving, are we having horse tonight or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.54,1:00:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴 给你啥你就吃啥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut yer cake hole, you'll eat what I pig ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.77,1:00:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他是厨子？什么东西都做成一个味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come he's the cook? Ev'rything tastes the same, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.43,1:00:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西都吃起来像鸡肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ev'rything tastes like chicken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.39,1:00:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了鸡肉以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except the chicken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.82,1:00:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡肉吃起来像鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what tastes like fish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.06,1:00:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 要心存感激多说好话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, a little appreciation would be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.82,1:00:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「非常感谢 伯特 」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thank you very much, Bert."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.54,1:00:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「非常棒的汤 伯特」 有那么难吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lovely stew, Bert." How hard is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加点松鼠便便就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just needs a sprinkle o' squirrel dung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.08,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那是我的烈酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's my grog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.07,1:01:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.45,1:01:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是精准的调味 真是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. That is beautifully balanced, that is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.49,1:01:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你屁股挪开 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap yer loganbie around that, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.30,1:01:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Good ain't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.45,1:01:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才是厨子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm the cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.02,1:01:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肚子乱叫了 我要吃点垫垫肚子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me guts are rambling. I've got to snack on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.12,1:01:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉 我要吃肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flesh. I need flesh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.70,1:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blimey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.12,1:01:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 看我鼻子里擤出什么来啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! Burt, look what's come out o' me hooter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.29,1:01:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有胳膊有腿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got arms and legs and ev'ryting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.72,1:01:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么人种？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.32,1:01:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可我不喜欢他扭来扭去的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I don't like the way he wriggles around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.95,1:02:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西？大松鼠吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are yer then? An oversized squirrel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.30,1:02:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个飞贼 呃 霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a burglar-uh, hobbit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.24,1:02:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「飞贼霍比特人」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "burglarhobit"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.38,1:02:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他煮了吃吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we cook him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.29,1:02:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.45,1:02:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了皮和骨头之后 他还不够我吃一口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't make more than a mouthful. Not when he's skinned and boned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.82,1:02:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许附近还有更多的飞贼霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}P'raps there's more burglarhobits 'round these parts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.99,1:02:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,够用来做个馅儿饼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be enough for a pie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.22,1:02:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮住他 他太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab him! He's too quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.47,1:02:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 过来 小可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oah, come here, you little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.68,1:02:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.61,1:02:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的小伙伴藏在你刚才那儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any more of you little fellas hiding where you shouldn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.14,1:02:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.11,1:02:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.37,1:02:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拎着他的脚趾头烤烤火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold his toes over the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.04,1:02:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他叫唤叫唤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him squeal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.38,1:02:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.67,1:02:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.78,1:02:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.57,1:02:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.94,1:04:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比尔博 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bilbo! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.81,1:04:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay down your arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.42,1:04:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就把他撕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll whip his off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.92,1:04:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么煮他们不用愁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother cooking 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.95,1:04:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好直接坐上去把他们压成肉酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to sit on 'em, and… squash 'em into jelly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.20,1:04:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该先腌一下 然后撒上鼠尾草烤了吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be so salted and grilled with a sprinkle of sage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.78,1:04:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really necessary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.53,1:04:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来确实不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does sound quite nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.55,1:05:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意调料了 已经过了大半夜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind the seas'ning, we ain't got all night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要黎明了 我们快点弄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn ain't far away, let's get a move on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.80,1:05:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想被变成石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fancy been turned to stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.11,1:05:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.68,1:05:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们犯大错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making a terrible mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.76,1:05:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们讲道理是没用的 他们是弱智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't reason with them, they're half-wits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.31,1:05:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱智？那我们成什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half-wits? What does that make us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.94,1:05:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 在烹饪的方面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant with the, uh, with the- with the seasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么烹饪的方面？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… about the seasoning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.84,1:05:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻过他们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you smelt them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.59,1:05:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们端上盘子前 你需要用比鼠尾草更多的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need something stronger than sage before you plate this lot up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.31,1:05:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.02,1:05:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么煮矮人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about cooking dwarf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.87,1:05:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 让这个飞贼霍比特人讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, and let the, uh, flurgerburburhobit talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.76,1:05:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,煮矮人的秘诀就是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the-the secret to cooking dwarf, is umm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.88,1:05:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.18,1:05:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.00,1:05:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是… - 告诉我们秘诀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's, uh, - tell us the secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.43,1:05:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确地说 秘诀就是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ye- yes, the damn thing is- the secret is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.74,1:05:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,先剥皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to… skin them first!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.95,1:05:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 给我切片刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, get me filleting knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.49,1:06:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我要捆了你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, I'll get you, you little-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.55,1:06:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会报仇的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't forget that, I won't forget t-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.42,1:06:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a load of rubbish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.10,1:06:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都带着皮吃了好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've eaten plenty with their skins on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.55,1:06:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是狼吞虎咽 连着鞋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoff 'em I say, boots and all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.87,1:06:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.15,1:06:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生吃矮人又怎么样呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with a bit o' raw dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道好 嘎吱脆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and crunchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.33,1:06:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吃那个 他有传染病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh no, not-not that one, he's infected!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.79,1:06:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.13,1:06:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有寄生虫在肚子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah he's got worms in his tubes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.65,1:06:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他们的身体里都有很多寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In- in fact, they all have. They're infested with parasites, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.04,1:06:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常糟糕 我的话就不会冒险 真的不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a terrible business, I wouldn't risk it, I really wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.23,1:06:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄生虫？他说的是寄生虫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parasite, did he say parasite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.48,1:06:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们没寄生虫啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't have parasites!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.13,1:06:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have parasites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.15,1:06:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有像我胳膊这么大的寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got parasites as big as my arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.38,1:06:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的最大 我有超级大的寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine are the biggest parasites, I've got huge parasites!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.93,1:06:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全身都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're riddled!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.66,1:06:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 全身都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all riddled!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.51,1:07:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坨大坨的寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes we are, badly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.92,1:07:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你让我们怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have us do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.02,1:07:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,全放他们走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em all go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.89,1:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.92,1:07:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道你在搞什么鬼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't know what you're up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.63,1:07:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小狐狸…拿我们当白痴呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little ferret… is taking us for fools!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.22,1:07:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狐狸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.98,1:07:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fools?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.98,1:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明之光将收服你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dawn will take you all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.33,1:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？ - 不晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - No idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.14,1:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能把他一块吃了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we eat him too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.14,1:07:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脚从我背上拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, get your foot out of my back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.48,1:08:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否问一下 你去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you go to, if I may ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.82,1:08:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看前面的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To look ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.57,1:08:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么又回来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brought you back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.88,1:08:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看后面的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.61,1:08:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是件好事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.11,1:08:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他们还没被撕烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still they all are in one piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.72,1:08:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该谢谢你的飞贼朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks to your burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.74,1:08:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在拖延时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had the nose to play for time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.88,1:08:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都没想到这个点子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the rest of you thought of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.60,1:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定是从伊顿荒原上下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have come down from the Ettenmoors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.69,1:08:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些山怪什么时候开始向南方走这么远了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when the mountain trolls venture this far South?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.63,1:08:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是太久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not for an age…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.51,1:08:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从黑暗力量统制这些地方开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since a darker power ruled these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.06,1:08:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们白天不能行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could not have moved in daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.85,1:08:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近肯定有个巢穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a cave nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.90,1:09:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么臭味？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh what's that stench?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.39,1:09:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是山怪的地洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a troll hoard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.84,1:09:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱摸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful what you touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.04,1:09:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样留这儿不太好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems a shame just to leave it lying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.40,1:09:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都可以来拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.99,1:09:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.25,1:09:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺力 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nori, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.95,1:09:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿铲子来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a shovel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.74,1:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些剑不是山怪铸造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These swords are not made by any troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.73,1:09:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是人类铁匠铸造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor were they made by any smith among men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.62,1:10:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在贡多林打造的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were forged in Gondolin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.11,1:10:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一纪元的最高级精灵打造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the High Elves, of the First Age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.06,1:10:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比这更好的刀刃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could not wish for a finer blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.04,1:10:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇力 来 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kili, come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.03,1:10:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.63,1:10:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在做一个长期存款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making a long-term deposit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.40,1:10:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这个臭地方吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of this foul place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.21,1:10:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.95,1:10:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,波佛 葛罗音 诺力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bofur, Gloin, Nori.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.46,1:11:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比尔博 - 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bilbo. - Hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.88,1:11:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 大小跟你刚合适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. This is about your size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.00,1:11:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接受这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.96,1:11:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把剑是由精灵族铸造的 就是说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade is of Elvish make, which means…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人和妖精在附近的时候 它会发出蓝光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will glow blue when orcs or goblins are nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.30,1:11:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前从没用过剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I- I have never used a sword in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.89,1:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望你永远不会用到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hope you'll never have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.29,1:11:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果用到了 谨记：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you do, remember this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.64,1:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的勇气不是何时去夺走一条生命…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}True courage… is about knowing not when to take a life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.52,1:11:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是何时去饶恕一条生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when to spare one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.17,1:11:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西在靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.84,1:11:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.78,1:11:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.87,1:11:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快 他们带着武装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, they're armed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.82,1:12:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.63,1:12:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷 纵火 杀人犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thieves! Fire! Murder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞达加斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radagast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.67,1:12:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是褐袍巫师瑞达加斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Radagast the Brown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.49,1:12:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.30,1:12:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for you, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.09,1:12:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了 出大事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong. Something's terribly wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.94,1:12:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.66,1:12:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想一想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me a minute, hm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.65,1:12:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.81,1:12:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个想法 这会儿又忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a thought and, now I've lost it, it was-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.90,1:12:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都快到嘴边了 可它停留在舌头上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was was right there, on the tip of my tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.19,1:12:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来不是个想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! It's not a thought at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.38,1:13:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just only a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.24,1:13:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,竹节虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stick insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.73,1:13:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿林地病了 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Greenwood is sick, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.28,1:13:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗笼罩了它 什么东西都不再生长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A darkness has fallen over it, nothing glows anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.95,1:13:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少好东西不再生长了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least nothing good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.10,1:13:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气中满是腐臭味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air is foul of decay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.18,1:13:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更糟的是那些网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but worse are the webs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.97,1:13:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,网？什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Webs? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.17,1:13:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 巨型蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spiders, Gandalf. Giant ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.29,1:13:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没看错的话 是安格利昂产的卵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of spawn of… Ungoliant, or I'm not a wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.97,1:13:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪了它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed their trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.24,1:13:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来自多尔哥多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came from… Dol Guldur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.76,1:13:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔哥多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dol Guldur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.11,1:13:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那古堡早已被废弃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the old fortress is abandoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.01,1:13:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.15,1:13:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没被废弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.22,1:14:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股黑暗力量住在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dark power dwells in there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.61,1:14:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我之前从没察觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}such as I have never felt before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.69,1:14:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个古老光环的影子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the shadow of an ancient aura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.00,1:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够召唤死人的幽灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that can summon the spirits of the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.48,1:14:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.09,1:14:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From out of the darkness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.88,1:14:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,死灵法师来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Necromancer has come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.44,1:15:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.98,1:15:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来口老托比烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try a little old Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.57,1:15:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你平静下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help setting your nerves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.72,1:15:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.47,1:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…关于死灵法师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… the Necromancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.31,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.38,1:16:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是来自于活人的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not… from the world…of the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.27,1:16:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是狼吗？那里有狼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a wolf? Are there- are there wolves out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.99,1:16:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.24,1:16:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that is not a wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.22,1:16:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是座狼侦察兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warg scouts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.94,1:16:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着半兽人大军就在后边不远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means an orc pack is not far behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.99,1:16:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人大军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orc pack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.01,1:16:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个探险告诉同族之外的哪些人了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you tell about your quest, beyond your kin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.35,1:16:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.18,1:16:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底告诉谁了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.19,1:16:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one, I swear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.36,1:16:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底他祖宗的怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in Dorin's name is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.06,1:16:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被追击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being hunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.67,1:16:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.19,1:16:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑不了 我们没有马 它们脱缰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't! We have no ponies. They bolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.43,1:16:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把他们引开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.02,1:16:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是刚达巴山座狼 它们能追上你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Gundabad wargs. They will outrun you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.08,1:16:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是罗斯戈贝尔兔子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Rhosgobel rabbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.48,1:17:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想可以试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see them try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.82,1:17:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.50,1:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.18,1:17:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.43,1:18:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧力 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ori, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.87,1:18:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.88,1:18:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部人前进 快 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you, come on, come on! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.72,1:18:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带我们去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're you leading us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.65,1:19:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人就在那里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.08,1:19:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.21,1:19:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.30,1:19:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.56,1:19:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.96,1:19:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.33,1:20:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会越来越多的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's more coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.12,1:20:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇力 射他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kili! Shoot them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.73,1:20:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被包围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're surrounded!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.65,1:20:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.48,1:20:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抛弃我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's abandoned us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.74,1:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住阵地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.20,1:20:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 一群笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, you fools!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.49,1:20:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Com'on, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.08,1:20:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都赶紧 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly! All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.23,1:20:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.10,1:21:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,… 九个 十个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nine, ten…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.43,1:21:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇力 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kili! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.57,1:21:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是精灵族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.90,1:21:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到这条路通向哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot see where the pathway leads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.24,1:21:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要往前走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we follow it or no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.59,1:21:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然往前走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We follow it, of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.06,1:22:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是明智的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that would be wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.75,1:23:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊姆拉里斯峡谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The valley of Imladris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.78,1:23:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常大家会叫他另一个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the common tongue, it's known by another name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.77,1:23:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.15,1:23:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是坐落在大海东边最后的守护所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here lies the last homely house, east of the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.54,1:23:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your plan all along…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.06,1:23:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我们的敌人寻求庇护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seek refuge with our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.67,1:23:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里你没有敌人 索林·橡木盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no enemies here, Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.29,1:23:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这峡谷里唯一的敌意就是你自己带来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only ill-will to be found in this valley is that which you bring yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.22,1:23:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得精灵族人会为我们的探险祈福吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the Elves… will give our quest their blessing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.62,1:23:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会试图阻止我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will try to stop us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.37,1:23:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, they will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.01,1:23:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们有问题需要解答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have questions that need to be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.00,1:23:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要成功 就需要策略{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are to be successful, this will need to be handled with tact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.73,1:23:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and respect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.30,1:23:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一点魅力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no small degree of charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.17,1:23:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才需要让我来沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why you will leave the talking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.45,1:24:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,米思兰迪尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.86,1:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 林德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Lindir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.92,1:25:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.12,1:25:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你来河谷了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.87,1:25:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须与爱隆王交谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak with Lord Elrond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.83,1:25:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱隆王不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Elrond is not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.10,1:25:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.79,1:25:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.41,1:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚拢到一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close ranks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.44,1:25:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.72,1:25:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱隆王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Elrond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.98,1:26:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.16,1:26:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.94,1:26:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎杀了一群来自南方的半兽人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.36,1:26:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在秘密隘口附近{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.53,1:26:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人这么靠近我们的边界真是奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange for orcs to come so close to our borders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.85,1:26:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些东西或某个人招引他们来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something or someone has drawn them near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.30,1:26:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 那应该是我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that may have been us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.21,1:26:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你索林 索恩之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome Thorin, son of Thrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.76,1:26:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没见过面吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe we have met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.82,1:26:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有你祖父的仪态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your Grandfather's bearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.05,1:26:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔统治山下的时候我认识他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Thror when he ruled under the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.54,1:26:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？他没提到过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed? He made no mention of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.91,1:27:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？他在骂我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he saying? Does he offer us insult?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.67,1:27:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 他说请我们吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Master Gloin, he's offering you food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.42,1:27:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.93,1:27:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就带路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, lead on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.44,1:27:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝 就一口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it. Just a mouthful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.52,1:27:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢绿色食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like green food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.30,1:27:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the meat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.57,1:27:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有炸薯条吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they got any chips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.59,1:27:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你邀请我们 可我没有正装赴宴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of you to invite us, I'm… not really dressed for diner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.57,1:27:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没有穿上过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you never are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.66,1:27:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是兽咬剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Orcrist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.23,1:28:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩妖剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Goblin-cleaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.19,1:28:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,著名的剑 由西方的高等精灵锻造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A famous blade, forged by the High Elves of the West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.62,1:28:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同胞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.99,1:28:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它能为你所用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May it serve you well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.92,1:28:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是格兰瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Glamdring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.78,1:28:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死敌之锤 贡多林国王的剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Foe-hammer, sword of the king of Gondolin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.85,1:28:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些剑是为第一纪元的妖精大战打造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These swords were made for the Goblin wars of the First-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.67,1:28:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't bother, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.02,1:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑的命名源自于它们在大战中的伟大功绩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swords are named for the great deeds they do in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.58,1:28:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说 我的剑还没有经过战争的洗礼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you saying, my sword hasn't seen battles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.55,1:28:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不确定它是不是一把剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not actually sure it is a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.84,1:28:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是把小刀 说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a letter opener, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.99,1:28:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么把这些剑带来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come with these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.59,1:28:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在东方大道上一个山怪的地洞里发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found them in a troll hoard on the Great East road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.44,1:28:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在中半兽人的埋伏之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shortly before we were ambushed by orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.76,1:28:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们在东方大道上做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what were you doing on the Great East road?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.56,1:28:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的事与精灵族无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our business is no concern of Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.77,1:28:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 索林 给他看看地图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For goodness sake. Thorin, show him the map!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.72,1:28:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的子民的遗产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the legacy of my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.01,1:28:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有责任保护它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine to protect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.24,1:29:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括其中的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are its secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.81,1:29:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再坚持你们矮人族的倔犟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me from the stubbornness of dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.64,1:29:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的骄傲会把你拽垮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pride will be your downfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.82,1:29:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土世界能读懂这张地图的人屈指可数 你面前的算一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand here in the presence of one of the few in Middle-earth who can read that map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.21,1:29:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给爱隆王看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show it to Lord Elrond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.84,1:29:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊鲁伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.78,1:29:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这张地图的什么感兴趣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your interest in this map?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.56,1:29:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是学术方面的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mainly academic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.78,1:29:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这类史前古物中会经常暗藏文字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, this sort of artifacts sometimes contains hidden texts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.02,1:29:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能读古矮人语 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still read ancient dwarvish, do you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.67,1:30:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 「色斯文·伊西尔」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, "Cirth ithil".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.93,1:30:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,月符文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moon runes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.54,1:30:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.15,1:30:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很轻易就会错过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An easy thing to miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.20,1:30:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿要想读到月符文 只能借助月光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in this case, that is true. Moon runes can only be read by the light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.85,1:30:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且月亮还要与写它的那一天具有相同的形状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the moon of the same shape and season as the day on which they were written.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.65,1:30:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能读到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.12,1:30:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,写这些符文的时候是在一个仲夏前夕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These runes were written on a mid-summer's eve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.29,1:30:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,新月的月光下 将近两百年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the light of a crescent moon nearly two hundred years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.25,1:30:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们注定要来瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem you were meant to come to Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.03,1:30:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运与你同在 索林·橡木盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate is with you, Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.18,1:30:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚恰巧是同样的月光照耀着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same moon shines upon us tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.76,1:31:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「画眉袭来的时候靠到青石边上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stand by the grey stone when the thrush knocks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.55,1:31:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,夕阳带着杜林日落的余光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the setting sun with the last light of Durin's Day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.37,1:31:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,将照在钥匙孔上「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will shine upon the key-hole".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.99,1:31:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜林日？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Durin's Day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.08,1:31:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是矮人族新年的开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is the start of the dwarves' new year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.19,1:31:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天 秋季最后一天的月亮和冬季第一天的太阳…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the last moon of Autumn and the first sun of Winter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.04,1:31:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会同时出现在天空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}appear in the sky together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.81,1:31:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ill news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.76,1:31:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏季马上就要过去 杜林日很快就来到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summer is passing. Durin's Day will soon be upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.72,1:31:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.00,1:31:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间 做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time, for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.94,1:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find the entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.61,1:31:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要到正确的地点 正确的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be standing at exactly the right spot, at exactly the right time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.52,1:31:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有那时…门才能被打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, and only then… can the door be opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.34,1:31:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就是你们的目的 进入到山脉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is your purpose. To enter the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.05,1:31:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.53,1:31:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人觉得这不甚明智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some who would not deem it wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.10,1:31:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.62,1:31:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们并非中土世界的唯一守护者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the only guardian to stand watching over Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.91,1:32:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些矮人 主人…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.60,1:32:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们跟丢了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.00,1:32:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那些臭精灵伏击 我们…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.20,1:32:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要借口{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.80,1:32:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要矮人王的头{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.20,1:32:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们兵力不够{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.20,1:32:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽力了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.80,1:32:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点没命{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.60,1:33:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.20,1:33:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此偿命{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.50,1:33:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人很快会露面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.10,1:33:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放话出去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.60,1:33:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍下他们的头有赏{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.33,1:34:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.20,1:34:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们帮不帮忙 矮人族都会向山脉行进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With or without our help, these dwarves will march on the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.55,1:34:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们决心收回他们的领地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're determined to reclaim their homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.61,1:34:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为索林·橡木盾觉得自己要对任何人负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe Thorin Oakenshield feels that he's answerable to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.95,1:34:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不用 - 因为他们要回应的人不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nor for that matter am I. - Cause it's not me they must answer to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.89,1:34:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖拉德丽尔夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Galadriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.64,1:34:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,米思兰迪尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.14,1:34:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.60,1:34:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,岁月或许改变了我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.77,1:34:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但罗瑞安夫人却没变{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.28,1:35:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道爱隆王把您请来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd no idea Lord Elrond had sent for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.10,1:35:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.16,1:35:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我请的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.08,1:35:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.89,1:35:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近很忙啊 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been busy of late, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.77,1:35:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Gandalf…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.12,1:35:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你的计划和方案都会被忽视么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think these plans and schemes of yours would go unnoticed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.78,1:35:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被忽视？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unnoticed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.66,1:35:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.18,1:35:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在做我认为正确的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm simply doing what I feel to be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.97,1:35:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那头恶龙上花了太多心思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragon… has long been on your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.92,1:35:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true, my Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.92,1:35:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,史矛革不效忠于任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smaug owes allegiance to no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.59,1:35:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他若站在敌人那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he should side with the enemy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.51,1:35:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,局势会变得很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dragon could be used to terrible effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.71,1:35:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么敌人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.84,1:35:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫 敌人已经被打败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf, the enemy is defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.85,1:36:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦已经被打败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sauron is vanquished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.01,1:36:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可能再回到他的全盛时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can never regain his full strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.88,1:36:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.29,1:36:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,四百年了 我们都生活在和平中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for four hundred years, we have lived in peace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.32,1:36:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是和平中暗藏危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hard won watchful peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.40,1:36:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的生活在和平中了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we- are we at peace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.52,1:36:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨魔从高山袭来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trolls have come down from the mountains, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.81,1:36:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们袭击村落 摧毁农庄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are raiding villages, destroying farms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.62,1:36:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,半兽人在路上袭击我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orcs have attacked us on the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.95,1:36:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争的序曲已经奏响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly a prelude to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.02,1:36:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是多管闲事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always you must meddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.52,1:36:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就爱无事生非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for trouble where none exist!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.71,1:36:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他说下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.85,1:36:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些比史矛革更邪恶的东西要应付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something at work beyond the evil of Smaug, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.97,1:36:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些比史矛革更强大的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}something far more powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.55,1:36:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们可以对它视若无睹 但它不会放过我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can remain blind to it, but it will not be ignoring us, that I can promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.00,1:36:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿林下暗潮汹涌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sickness hides over the Greenwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.88,1:36:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的伐木人称之为幽暗密林 他们说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woodsmen who live there now call it Mirkwook, and uh, they s- they say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.53,1:37:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停 伐木人说什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't stop now, tell us what the woodsmen say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.07,1:37:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提及过居住在多尔哥多的死灵法师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They speak of a Necromancer, living in Dol Guldur, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.48,1:37:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以召唤亡者的巫师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a sorcerer who would summon the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.96,1:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒诞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's absurd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.65,1:37:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上不存在这种力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such power exists in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.35,1:37:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,死灵法师也是凡人而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… Necromancer is nothing more than a mortal man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.14,1:37:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是研习黑魔法的巫师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A conjurer dabbling in black magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.86,1:37:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经也是这么想 不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I thought too. But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.66,1:37:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞达加斯特看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radagast has seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.79,1:37:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞达加斯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radagast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.36,1:37:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟我提起褐袍瑞达加斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not speak to me of Radagast the Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.81,1:37:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a foolish fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.83,1:37:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个怪人 这点我同意 他一直独居{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… he's odd, I grant you, he lives a solitary life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.16,1:37:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.32,1:37:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他蘑菇吃得太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his excessive consumption of mushrooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.11,1:37:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋吃糊涂了 牙齿也吃黄了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've addled his brain, and yellowed his teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.50,1:37:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.25,1:37:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个埃斯塔力（巫师）成员在深林游荡总不是什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is unbefitting one of the Istari wandering the wood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.49,1:37:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了东西来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.47,1:37:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是瑞达加斯特给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came to you from Radagast…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.58,1:38:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在多尔哥多找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found it in Dul Guldur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.22,1:38:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.96,1:38:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.81,1:38:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.23,1:38:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件魔多遗物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A relic of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.53,1:38:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔窟剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Morgul blade…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.93,1:38:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是为安格马的巫妖王打造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made for the witch-king of Angmar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.99,1:38:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,并已随他一起下葬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and buried with him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.09,1:38:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当安格马沦陷时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Angmar fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.23,1:38:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,北方的人带走了他的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of the North took his body, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.10,1:38:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所有的东西都被封印在鲁道夫山上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all that he possessed was sealed within the high fells of Rhudaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.61,1:38:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,深葬于岩石的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep within the rock, they buried him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.09,1:39:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗墓穴中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a tomb so dark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.25,1:39:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可能重见天日的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it couldn't have come to light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.32,1:39:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.48,1:39:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些墓穴上有着强大的符咒 他们不可能被打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A powerful spell lies upon those tombs, they cannot be opened!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.13,1:39:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有什么证据证明这把剑是来自安格马的墓穴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What proof do we have this weapon came from Angmar's grave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.80,1:39:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.26,1:39:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为根本没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there is none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.89,1:39:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来分析一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us examine what we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.47,1:39:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小撮半兽人穿过了布鲁南河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single orc pack has dared to cross the Bruinen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.77,1:39:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把古剑重见天日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dagger from a by-gone age has been found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.28,1:39:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个自称死灵法师的男巫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a human sorcerer who calls himself the Necromancer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.76,1:39:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在荒废的森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has taken up residence in a ruined fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.82,1:39:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not so very much, after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.59,1:39:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种矮人才让我困扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question of this dwarvish company however, troubles me deeply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.80,1:39:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很相信 甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not convinced, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.02,1:39:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为我能容忍这种事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not feel I can condone such a quest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.79,1:40:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们来找我 我只好让他们失望了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come to me, I might just spare them this disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.25,1:40:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会假装能够理解你让他们燃起希望的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not pretend to understand your reasons for raising their hopes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.41,1:40:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.45,1:40:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.26,1:40:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.14,1:40:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没什么别的办法了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'm afraid there's nothing else for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.86,1:40:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱隆阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Elrond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.64,1:40:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些矮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dwarves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.44,1:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.94,1:40:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警惕点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be on your guard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.91,1:40:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进入荒野边境了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're about to step over the Edge of the Wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.92,1:40:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴林 你熟悉路 带路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balin, you know this path, lead on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.49,1:40:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.71,1:40:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯大人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Baggins, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.82,1:40:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你还是跟上的好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.78,1:41:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will follow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.49,1:41:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.71,1:41:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮助索林·橡木盾是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right to help Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.05,1:41:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我担心这次探险惊动了一些我们未知的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I fear this quest has set in motion forces we do not yet understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.07,1:41:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔窟剑之秘必须解开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The riddle of the Morgul blade must be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.24,1:41:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些暗流在未知阴影中涌动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something moves in the shadows, unseen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.83,1:41:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它躲着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden from our side, it will not show itself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.08,1:41:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不愿露面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.07,1:41:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它每天都在变强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every day it grows in strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.07,1:41:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须小心谨慎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.92,1:41:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.57,1:41:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,米斯兰迪尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.94,1:41:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选哈夫林（即霍比特人）？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the Halfling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.91,1:41:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.50,1:42:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼认为只有强大的力量才能震慑邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saruman believes that it is only a great power that can hold evil in check, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.90,1:42:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is not what I have found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.40,1:42:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得日常琐事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it is… the small things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.15,1:42:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通人每天的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyday deeds of ordinary folk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.03,1:42:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够遏制黑暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that keep the darkness at bay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.47,1:42:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如平凡的善与爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}simple acts of kindness and love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.93,1:42:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是比尔博·巴金斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Bilbo Baggins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.28,1:42:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是他能给恐惧中的我带来勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it is because I am afraid and he gives me courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.87,1:42:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕 米斯兰迪尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be afraid, Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.18,1:42:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不孤单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.08,1:42:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我帮助的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.78,1:42:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会出现{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.96,1:44:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.89,1:44:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要找个藏身之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find shelter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.45,1:44:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.87,1:44:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.59,1:44:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no thunderstorms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.61,1:45:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是雷霆之战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a thunder-battle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.15,1:45:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.30,1:45:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well bless me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.12,1:45:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legends are true!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.09,1:45:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人 岩石巨人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giants! Stone giants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.67,1:45:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护 蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover, you fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.23,1:45:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.87,1:45:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇力 抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kili, grab my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.50,1:45:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？奇力 抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Kili, grab my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.46,1:46:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑啊 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, run, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.28,1:46:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑 跑啊 - 快跑 继续 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run, run, run!- Let's run! Come on, keep on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.69,1:46:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.94,1:47:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.39,1:47:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊 奇力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.96,1:47:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还好 我们还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're alright! We're alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.90,1:47:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.03,1:47:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍比特人去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the hobbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.40,1:47:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.36,1:47:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.10,1:47:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on and take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.57,1:47:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you, lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.74,1:47:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.98,1:47:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.18,1:48:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为把我们的飞贼弄丢了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd lost our burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.67,1:48:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.03,1:48:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一离开家就已经把自己弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been lost ever since he left home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.36,1:48:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本就不该来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should never have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.56,1:48:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当中没有他的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no place amongst us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.29,1:48:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瓦林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwalin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.06,1:48:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来很安全 看看周围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks safe enough. Search nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.05,1:48:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这山里的洞穴很少没人住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caves in the mountain are seldom unoccupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.26,1:48:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.05,1:48:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好 我们来生火吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then. Let's get the fire started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.50,1:48:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别生火 这里不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No fires. Not in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.66,1:48:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一觉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.26,1:48:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们破晓出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start at the first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.09,1:48:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在山上等到甘道夫过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were to wait in the mountains until Gandalf joined us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.85,1:48:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是原计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.37,1:48:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.99,1:48:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,波佛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bofur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.37,1:48:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一个值夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the first watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.61,1:49:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚留下的气味{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.41,1:49:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了大山隘口{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.67,1:49:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.85,1:50:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.61,1:50:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.05,1:50:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能现在回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you can't turn back, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.75,1:50:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是团队的一部分 你是我们中的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're part of the company. You're one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.74,1:50:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不是了？对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not now, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.35,1:50:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林说我不该来 他是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin said I should never have come, and he was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.76,1:50:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是图克家的 我是巴金斯家的 我不知道我那时在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a Took, I'm a Baggins, I don't know what I was thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.84,1:50:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不该跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've never ran out the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.39,1:50:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是想家了 我理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're homesick. I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.99,1:50:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不理解 你不理解 你们这些矮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't! You don't understand, none of you do, you're dwarves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.11,1:50:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都习惯了这种生活 颠沛流离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're used to th- to this life, to living on the road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.61,1:50:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,居无定所 了无牵挂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}never settling in one place, not belonging anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.57,1:50:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我并不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, I didn- hmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.74,1:50:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.82,1:51:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不属于任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't belong anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.08,1:51:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you all the luck in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.44,1:51:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.36,1:51:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.16,1:51:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.54,1:51:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.26,1:52:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.46,1:52:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave my- go away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.10,1:52:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.75,1:52:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.92,1:54:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁这么大胆敢带着武器来到我的领土？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would be so bold as to come armed into my kingdom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.28,1:54:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是间谍？小偷？刺客？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spies? Thieves? Assassins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.88,1:54:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人 邪恶之人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwarves, your Malevolence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.72,1:54:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.89,1:54:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在前门发现了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found them on the front porch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.64,1:55:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要干站在那里 搜他们身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well don't just stand there, search them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.32,1:55:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个头盔和箭袋都不要放过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every crowns, every quivers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.32,1:55:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.04,1:55:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.76,1:55:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 既然他们不说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, if they will not talk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.88,1:55:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让他们叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll make them squawk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.58,1:55:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把绞肉机抬上来 把碎骨机抬上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up the mangler, bring up the bone breaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.18,1:55:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从最年轻的开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with the youngest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.07,1:55:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.67,1:55:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well well well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.12,1:55:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.42,1:55:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林 索恩之子 索尔之孙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin, son of Thrain, son of Thror, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.64,1:55:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,山下之王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}king under the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.73,1:55:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我忘记你没有山了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! But I'm forgetting you don't have mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.00,1:55:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是国王 这样来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not a king. Which makes you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.93,1:56:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就什么也不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.41,1:56:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个人… 他愿意为你的头出个大价钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know someone… who would pay a petty price for your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.03,1:56:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.07,1:56:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的都不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing attached.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.99,1:56:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你知道我在说谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you know of whom I speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.95,1:56:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老敌人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old enemy of yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.21,1:56:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,白半兽人 骑着白狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pale Orc… astride a white Warg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.36,1:56:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭者阿索格… 他已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azog the Defiler… was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.76,1:56:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在很久以前的战斗中就被杀死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was slain in battle long ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.34,1:56:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就觉得他的日子结束了 是么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think his defiling days are done, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.88,1:56:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉白半兽人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send word to the Pale Orc, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.75,1:56:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说我找到了他的宝贝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell him I have found his prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.28,1:57:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.21,1:57:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.74,1:57:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.79,1:57:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕噜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gollum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.05,1:57:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.25,1:57:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕噜 咕噜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gollum! Gollum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.77,1:58:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心的… 妖精…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty… Goblinses… are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.03,1:58:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比老骨头好多了 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}better than old bones, precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.50,1:58:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,比什么都没有好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than… nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.01,1:58:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 骨头太多了 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah, too many boneses, precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.75,1:58:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多少肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.05,1:58:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 把皮剥了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Cut its skin off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.41,1:58:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with its head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.75,1:59:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 土地又冷又硬 他们咬我们的手 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The cold hard lands, they bites our hands ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.46,1:59:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 咬我们的脚 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ they gnaws our feet ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.98,1:59:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为岩石都像老骨头 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ for rocks and stones are like old bones ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.12,1:59:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 全没有血肉 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ all bare of meat ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.04,1:59:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和死亡一样冰冷 死了更好下口 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ cold as death, without no breath it's good to eat ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.04,2:00:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑我们 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless us and splash us, precious, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.84,2:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一口下去都是肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a meaty mouthful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.43,2:00:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕噜 咕噜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gollum! Gollum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.10,2:00:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 往后退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back. Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.77,2:00:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you, don't come any closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.11,2:00:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着精灵剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got an Elfish blade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.57,2:00:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不是精灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not an Elfes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.88,2:00:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是精灵 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not an Elfes, no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.30,2:00:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whot is it, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.43,2:00:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whot is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.03,2:00:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.12,2:00:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.32,2:00:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bagginses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.07,2:00:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是巴金斯 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whot is a Bagginses, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.95,2:00:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夏尔来的霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a… hobbit from the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.34,2:00:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喜欢妖精 蝙蝠和鱼 但还没吃过霍比特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like goblinses, batses and fishes, but we hasn't try Hobbinses before!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.79,2:00:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很嫩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it soft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.62,2:00:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多汁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it juicy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.95,2:01:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, keep-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.36,2:01:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.70,2:01:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要 我会用上这个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll use this. If I have too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.45,2:01:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想惹麻烦 你明白么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't-I don't want any trouble, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.97,2:01:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我出去的路 然后我自己离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just show me the way to get out of here, and I'll be on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.22,2:01:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？他迷路了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Is it lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.26,2:01:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我想尽快找到回去的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, and I want to get unlost, as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.88,2:01:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道霍比特人的安全出路 隐藏在黑暗中的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we knows! We knows safe path for hobbitses. Safe path in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.67,2:01:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.05,2:01:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.13,2:01:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.09,2:01:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 宝贝 我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, we- we was, precious, we was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.41,2:01:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你玩什么游戏 不过我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I- I don't know what you're game is. but I-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.78,2:01:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.64,2:01:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喜欢游戏 是吧 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh we love games, doesn't we, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.40,2:01:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢游戏么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it like games?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.59,2:01:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢么？他喜欢玩儿么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it, does it, does it like to play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.52,2:01:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.11,2:01:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西有脚无人见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has roots as nobody sees, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.83,2:01:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,个子高高赛大树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is taller than trees, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.28,2:01:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,高耸入云霄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up, up it goes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.85,2:02:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是从来不长个儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet never grows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.94,2:02:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大山 - 是的 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The moutain. - Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.88,2:02:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have another one, uh?{\r}
