Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.59,2:10:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.93,2:10:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.48,2:10:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 骨头敲碎 脖子扭断 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Bones will be shattered, neck will be wrung ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.28,2:10:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 严刑拷打 挂上刑架 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You'll be beaten and battered, from racks you'll be hung ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.10,2:10:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 变成美餐 尸骨无存 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You will dine down here and never be found ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.09,2:10:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 葬身于此 妖精之城 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Down in the deep of Goblin town ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.42,2:10:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那把剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.07,2:10:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是斩妖剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the Goblin-cleaver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.87,2:10:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噬人之刃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Biter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.56,2:10:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了成千上万的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade that sliced a thousand neck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.84,2:11:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍他们 打他们 剥他们的皮 杀死他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}slash them, beat them, peel them, kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.08,2:11:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的头砍下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut up his head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.70,2:11:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take up arms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.60,2:11:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.21,2:11:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.22,2:11:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他使用死敌之锤 和阳光一样刺眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wields the Foe-hammer, the Beater, bright as daylight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.92,2:12:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.69,2:12:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.19,2:12:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.03,2:12:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.84,2:12:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.60,2:13:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.70,2:13:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thiefs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.51,2:13:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.60,2:13:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.95,2:13:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.99,2:13:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One! Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.43,2:13:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Post!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.56,2:13:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.25,2:14:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把绳子砍断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the ropes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.18,2:15:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.66,2:15:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.39,2:15:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.69,2:15:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.98,2:16:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得你们能从我这里跑掉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you could escape me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.05,2:16:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要做什么呢 巫师？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do now, wizard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.18,2:16:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.17,2:16:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that will do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.65,2:17:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有更糟的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that could have been worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.73,2:17:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be joking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.52,2:17:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.41,2:17:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了 我们打不过他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many, we can't fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.24,2:17:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一样东西能救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one thing will save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.88,2:17:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daylight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.95,2:17:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.40,2:17:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 站好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, on your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.50,2:18:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等… 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… my precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.97,2:18:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.87,2:18:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕噜 咕噜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gollum! Gollum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.25,2:19:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.99,2:20:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.25,2:20:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒他 诅咒他 我们永远失去它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse it and crush it, we lost it for ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.93,2:20:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 六 七 八…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five… Six… Seven… Eight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.69,2:20:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕佛… 波佛 十个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bifur… Bofur… that's ten, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.99,2:20:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力 奇力… 十二个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fili, Kili… that's twelve, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.82,2:20:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞博 十三个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bombur, that makes thirteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.31,2:20:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.81,2:20:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍比特人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your hobbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.02,2:20:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的霍比特人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is our hobbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.25,2:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的半身人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse that Halfling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.05,2:20:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了？我还以为和朵力在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's lost? I thought he was with Dori!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.86,2:20:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.38,2:20:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后一次看到他是在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where did you last see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.92,2:20:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像在咱们第一次被困住的时候就看到他溜走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw him slip away when they first cornered us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.08,2:20:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happened exactly? Tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.96,2:20:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.88,2:20:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴金斯大人看到机会就趁机溜走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Baggins saw his chance and he took it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.88,2:21:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他踏出家门的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's thought of nothing but his soft bed and his warm hearth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.36,2:21:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就一直惦记家里的软床和壁炉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since first he stepped out of his door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.29,2:21:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不会看到霍比特人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not be seeing our hobbit again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.28,2:21:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is long gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.20,2:21:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.10,2:21:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.11,2:21:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo Baggins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.19,2:21:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没因为见到一个人而这么高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been so glad to see anyone in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.03,2:21:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博… 我们以为你走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo… We'd given you up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.13,2:21:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么从妖精群中逃脱的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How on earth did you get past the goblins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.16,2:21:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.90,2:21:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.17,2:21:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.97,2:21:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.48,2:21:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.97,2:22:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.01,2:22:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一直质疑我 一直{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you doubt me. I know- I know you always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.63,2:22:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 我常想回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right, I often think of Bag End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.16,2:22:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念我的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my books…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.94,2:22:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的摇椅 我的花园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my arm chair, and my garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.80,2:22:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就属于那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's where I belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.81,2:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.29,2:22:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的原因是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I came back, cause…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.70,2:22:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have one. A home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.36,2:22:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被抢走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was taken from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.92,2:22:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会尽一切所能帮你夺回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will help you take it back if I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.06,2:23:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,追上他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.76,2:23:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们扯成碎片{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.98,2:23:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,才出虎穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the frying pan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.40,2:23:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,又入狼窝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:16.50,2:23:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.40,2:23:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.71,2:24:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬到树上去 所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up into the trees. All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.50,2:24:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬 比尔博 快爬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, climb, Bilbo. Climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.82,2:24:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.37,2:25:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿索格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.33,2:25:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.93,2:25:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧的气味{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.33,2:25:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你的父亲就散发过这种气味{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.63,2:25:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林 索恩之子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.60,2:25:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:58.17,2:25:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是我的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:00.37,2:26:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉其他的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.27,2:26:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝光他们的血{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.33,2:27:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:11.57,2:28:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.90,2:28:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.57,2:28:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.07,2:28:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.46,2:28:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 诺力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Nori!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.73,2:30:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:18.25,2:30:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.34,2:30:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那矮人的头给我砍来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.24,2:31:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:08.62,2:34:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.26,2:35:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.44,2:35:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,索林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.24,2:35:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失败了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I failed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.26,2:35:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.78,2:35:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔博在这里 他很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilbo is here. He's quite safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.86,2:36:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.79,2:36:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:13.99,2:36:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你可能会把自己害死么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you could've yourself killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.40,2:36:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过你是个累赘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I not say that you would be a burden?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.73,2:36:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能在荒野里活下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you would not survive in the wild…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.41,2:36:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当中没有你的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you had no place amongst us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.87,2:36:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生中从未错得如此离谱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never been so wrong, in all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.93,2:36:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉曾经怀疑过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry I doubted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.75,2:36:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实我也怀疑我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I- I would have doubted me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.92,2:36:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是英雄 不是战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hero… nor a warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.97,2:37:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连飞贼都不算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:19.64,2:37:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？你觉得那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? What do you think it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:37.76,2:37:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊鲁柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ereborn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:40.25,2:37:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lonely Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.46,2:37:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,中土世界最后的矮人王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of the Great Dwarf Kingdoms of Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.62,2:37:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.75,2:37:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,渡鸦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A raven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:57.08,2:38:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟儿归山了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The birds are returning to the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:03.65,2:38:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一只画眉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my dear Oin, is a thrush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.49,2:38:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个好兆头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take it as a sign…a good omen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.34,2:38:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:14.50,2:38:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信最坏的时候已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe the worst is behind us.{\r}
